// Task - GyrfalconTask 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - MaxMission2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Flashback Text :
"P1824707263" "Gyrfalcon is back in action now. It seems like we'll have to keep our eyes on the 5th Column once again if Requiem has taken back full control.<br><br>Requiem's presence would explain the empowered 5th Column we heard about. Anyway, that's something we can worry about once the world isn't about to be devoured by a god of death, eh?"
// Answer Text :
"P2054312153" "Let's get back to business."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P789955118" "Gyrfalcon's rough with the field operatives, but he's known for always going in and getting them out of a bad situation, when it's called for. After the whole business with Reichsman, Gyrfalcon was captured again by 5th Column soldiers.<br><br>We have reason to believe that it was Reichsman himself leading the group that apprehended Gyrfalcon. Our intelligence reports indicate Reichsman is trying to rebuild his empowerment machine after the disaster that was his first attempt at an invasion.<br><br>We have a location on where Gyrfalcon is being held, however, it won't be easy to recover him. If we have him, however, he will prove extremely useful in the field against the Knives of Vengeance."
// AcceptString :
"P2769914188" "Hold on, Reichsman is free? How did that happen?"
// SendOffString :
"P2580998627" "There was a massive attack by members of the 5th Column to release Reichsman some time ago. It looks like he had a back up plan in the event of his defeat.<br><br>Anyway, the main difficulty will be from the presence of Reichsman in the base.<br><br>There have also been strange reports of empowered 5th Column members entering the base, though our spies went silent afterwards. <color orange>You'll want to be on your guard in there, it won't be easy to handle, especially if you're going in alone. Reichsman is going to be <i>incredibly</i> difficult to take down, even with your abilities. If you have some friends who can help you, now would be the time to call 'em in.</color>"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1420213286" "Rescue Gyrfalcon from the 5th Column"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P319648820" "Good luck in there, {HeroName}. Reichsman is powerful, even without his empowerment machine."
// TaskTitle :
"P950020105" "<color deepskyblue>Rebuilding the Column  (Dark Astoria Chapter 3)</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3838269991" "Malta air-lifted you to the entrance of this 5th Column base. Outside of the base were the unconscious bodies of several 5th Column soldiers. Is someone else after Gyrfalcon?"
// Script Variable ObjectiveUIText :
"P3142546266" "Defeat Reichsman to free Gyrfalcon"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P796476101" "The traitors were no match for our new power!"
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P3315913048" "Ah, an incarnate. A perfect chance to really test out our abilities!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P3818857370" "<t=2 d=2><t=5 d=5>They were fools to refuse to follow Requiem into the past."
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P817051077" "What shall we do with the prisoners?"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P600572993" "<t=2 d=2><t=5 d=5>They will either fall in line and become us, or be killed."
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P3362233671" "How did you find out about this base, {HeroName}?"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P1521585092" "The man known as Gyrfalcon is somewhere here. What were the orders?"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P3327202035" "<t=2 d=2><t=5 d=5>Requiem is personally handling Reichsman and Gyrfalcon. We have nothing to worry about."
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P2197089072" "You won't make it past us, {HeroName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// CutScene 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// 5 Actor1 :
"P2827793011" "Urgh... Requiem... I hadn't expected you to be this powerful."
// 5 Actor2 :
"P1091179394" "<t=5 d=5>You could say my trip to Cimerora brought me back to my roots, Reichsman."
// 7 Actor2 :
"P3812903021" "<t=7 d=7>It looks like your plans to use Gyrfalcon to rebuild your machine never became a reality..."
// 5 Actor2 :
"P2490920810" "<t=5 d=5>And now... you're barely as powerful as Statesman once was."
// 5 Caption :
"P2239143661" "<x=0.8 y=0.2 t=5 d=5><scale 1.75><color Crimson<bgcolor Black>It's funny, isn't it? You tried to take everything from me"
// 5 Actor2 :
"P1239398794" "<t=5 d=5>My army... my power... and now, my life. But you failed on every attempt."
// 7 Actor2 :
"P2440035848" "<t=7 d=7>From this day forward, Reichsman, YOU will serve ME, and I shall lead the 5th Column to TRUE power and REAL VICTORY!"
// 7 Actor2 :
"P3887362159" "<t=7 d=7>Our first order of business will be killing {HeroName}, then using our forces to absorb whatever monstrosity is boiling within Dark Astoria."
// Script Variable ACTOR_1_NAME :
"P2668258976" "Reichsman"
// Script Variable ACTOR_2_NAME :
"P2026798565" "Requiem"
// Script Variable ACTOR_3_NAME :
"P1215206417" "Gyrfalcon"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P337629768" "Give me a hand here, {HeroName}, she won't go quietly!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3731237859" "Alright {HeroName}, we can clean this up if we kill Washington!"
// Script Variable BOSS_1_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2999585671" "{HeroName}. Do you think your Incarnate abilities can match that of myself and Reichsman? Let's find out."
// Script Variable BOSS_2_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2214529090" "For now, Requiem, you have my aid against {HeroName}."
// Script Variable Greeting :
"P3177773160" "Hello there."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2836457115" "Now you die!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1738482053" "Nevermind"

