// Dialog - MaxMission4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Flashback Text :
"P2630629989" "<color orange>You try to call up Max only to receive a message that the number has been disconnected. It seems that with the destruction of the Knives, Malta no longer requires communication with you.<br><br>You do, however, see a message on your communicator from Praetor Duncan, who expresses interest in working together with you in tracking down Diabolique.<br><br>You remember Olympian 29's comment, which was that the Talons of Vengeance seemed to be here because of Diabolique, and that she had some connection to Mot. You'll have to see what Praetor Duncan knows on the matter, as this can either bring you one step closer to defeating Mot, or into a trap set by the Praetorians."
// Page NonFlashback Text :
"P3376940513" "<color orange>You try to call up Max only to receive a message that the number has been disconnected. It seems that with the destruction of the Knives, Malta no longer requires communication with you.<br><br>You do, however, see a message on your communicator from Praetor Duncan, who expresses interest in working together with you in tracking down Diabolique.<br><br>You remember Olympian 29's comment, which was that the Talons of Vengeance seemed to be here because of Diabolique, and that she had some connection to Mot. You'll have to see what Praetor Duncan knows on the matter, as this can either bring you one step closer to defeating Mot, or into a trap set by the Praetorians.</color><br><br><span align=center><color yellow>Praetor Duncan has been added to your contact list.</color></span>"
// Answer Text :
"P1938454969" "(Max's Personal Story)"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Olympian 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P1549335732" "{HeroName}. I am <color yellow>Olympian 29</color>, one of Emperor Cole's Olympian Guard.<br><br>I am here on the behalf of <color yellow>Praetor Duncan</color>. We believe that a woman we are tracking, named <color red>Diabolique</color>, is within this facility. However, I've determined this to be an extremely dangerous area.<br><br>I would suggest that you and I join together. I am here strictly to recover Diabolique and not to hamper your efforts."
// Answer Text :
"P871996122" "How do I know I can trust you?"
// Answer Text :
"P1144681534" "Where is Praetor Duncan?"
// Answer Text :
"P4083919222" "I'm not going to work together with you."
// Answer Text :
"P546249075" "I recall Neuron's experiments to create you all. I hope you're better than the first Olympian."
// Page ShowKnowledge Text :
"P2853565233" "I can assure you that everything with the Olympians has been perfected, {HeroName}. As you can see, I am fully functional and talking to you like a normal human being.<br><br>My main goal is to assist Praetor Duncan in the retrieval of Diabolique. I will not waver from that, unless you decide to get in the way of that goal."
// Page Question Text :
"P1227152797" "Because we are both after the same thing, in a sense. Praetor Duncan believes Diabolique's presence here has something to do with the Talons of Vengeance appearing, which would tie in with these Knives of Vengeance.<br><br>Emperor Cole himself has ordered Praetor Duncan and myself to get to the bottom of this. The Emperor has no desire to see Primal Earth destroyed by a god of death, {HeroName}.<br><br>For the will of the Emperor, I will not allow Mot or anyone else to destroy Primal Earth."
// Answer Text :
"P491503536" "Alright, but where is Praetor Duncan?"
// Answer Text :
"P21656439" "Alright, Olympian 29, let's work together."
// Answer Text :
"P2903903976" "I'm not going to work with you."
// Page Duncan Text :
"P1199757590" "Praetor Duncan is in a safe location within Primal Earth. Her safety is of the upmost concern of mine, as ordered by her.<br><br>She is currently monitoring all of my activities, including the conversation you and I are currently having."
// Answer Text :
"P4060782435" "Leave"
// Page Refuse Text :
"P971659223" "I must warn you, {HeroName}. If you do not work together with me, then you are making yourself my enemy, and I will be forced to respond as such.<br><br>Do not force my hand when all I wish is to act as your ally in this task."
// Answer Text :
"P3789961638" "Alright, Olympian 29, you can work with me."
// Answer Text :
"P3034645860" "I still refuse!"
// Page Refuse2 Text :
"P776577390" "Olympian attacks"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P4218533586" "Alright, this isn't gonna be easy by a longshot, but it's the only shot we've got, eh? The Knives of Artemis make their homebase in a dojo out in the middle of nowhere, Tibet. How these Talons of Vengeance transformed them, I've got no idea, but these gals are all just twisted monsters. Whatever was left of their old, cold-blooded killer selves, are gone, replaced by... well, cold-blooded killers who are <i>monsters</i>. There's a distinct difference.<br><br>I'm not going to lie, {HeroName}, this is going to be a tough fight. You're going straight into the heart of their territory."
// AcceptString :
"P3499252530" "I can handle it. Tell me how to get there."
// SendOffString :
"P217371420" "Your transportation to the area will be arranged. All you need to worry about is ripping out whatever is in the heart of the Knives of Vengeance.<br><br><color orange>You'll want to bring everything you've got on this one, {HeroName}. If you win here, it's gonna be a huge blow against Mot.</color><br><br>All I can do at this point is wish you good luck, because I won't waste any more words on this situation."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1600676837" "Destroy the Knives of Vengeance"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1644424056" "No time to back down now, {HeroName}."
// TaskTitle :
"P1243968386" "<color deepskyblue>The End of Vengeance (Dark Astoria Chapter 3)</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1096065182" "You arrive in the secret base of the Knives of Vengeance and see... a member of the Praetorian Olympian Guard!"
// Script Variable ObjectiveUIText :
"P464689372" "Speak with the Olympian Guard"
// Script Variable WaypointNames :
"P1760723720" "Olympian 29"
// Script Variable ObjectiveUIText :
"P3768817524" "Defeat Olympian 29"
// Script Variable ObjectiveUIText :
"P1500687548" "Destroy the source of the Knives of Vengeance"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3383608100" "Nothing"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P518059009" "<t=7 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=7><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkMagenta>Director 11 here. I've got the place wired, just took out a number of the Knives who were waiting in ambush for you."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P619380077" "<t=6 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkSlateBlue>Slinger here, you're entering a maze that the Knives set up.<t=6 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkSlateBlue>If you go the wrong way, they're gonna hit you hard, but there's an easy path to follow.<t=6 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkSlateBlue>See that rug? If you just follow that, you'll get yourself straight out of there, no fuss."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2359997401" "<t=7 caption x= 0.6 y=0.3 d=7><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkSlateBlue>The Orestes field is active, {HeroName}, it'll stop her from healing up. Finish her off!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P832094681" "<t=6 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkMagenta>Looks like another set of my mines just went off. Probably took care of reinforcements that the Keres was calling in."
// Script Variable BOSS_DEAD_DIALOG :
"P235661299" "We could... have worked... together..."
// Script Variable HERO_ACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3529985407" "I will follow you, {HeroName}."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1957828842" "For Emperor Cole!"
// Script Variable HERO_ACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3241055229" "Alright, let's end this."
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P1907264824" "<shout>Destroy the intruder!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P3491407246" "<shout>This is our home, you shall not survive here!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P1243932027" "<shout>You will not leave here alive!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P108379891" "<shout>Attack!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P1119068585" "<shout>This is still our home, you are not welcomed here!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P1420457275" "<shout>You were a fool to come here!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P1231184163" "<shout>Your corpse will decorate our walls!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P153264496" "<shout>You will not escape!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P462726206" "<shout>Destroy {HeroName}!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P3796046220" "<shout>You will not survive!"

