"P3571567476" "Now we die..."
// Script Variable NPC_DIALOG_NAME :
"P3352535467" "Diabolique"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1633324319" "<t=10 d=5>Now, I think you're being a little too hasty. I'm giving you a perfectly good offer.<t=10 d=5>You can try. But I'm with Mot now, and we make such a lovely couple.<t=10 d=5>I have my ways, why do you think I came to Primal Earth. Now, do we have a deal?"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P394419014" "{HeroName}! Well, looks like the Knives are at an end. Ta!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P2942041940" "Keres"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2508240163" "Diabolique! {HeroName}, you will not stop us from purifying this world!"
// Script Variable BOSS_KILLEDHERO_DIALOG :
"P3496441036" "<t=5 d=5>The Knives... were supposed to... purge this world... why...?<t=5 d=5>Are we doomed... to fail against both Diabolique... and the injustice of your world...?"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1759766426" "<t=5 d=5><t=10 d=5>I will not hand over the Knives to you, Diabolique! I will strike you down where you stand!<t=10 d=5>You? How did you gain favor with that monster?"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P577225789" "You may have halted our progress the first time in Cimerora, but you will NOT stop us here!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2519377419" "The world needs to be purified, {HeroName}. Our gaze has been away from the world for far too long!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1899623025" "No... there is still too much for me to do! The Knives of Vengeance must carry on!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2103979867" "What is this?! Who is dampening my powers!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P2777384219" "<shout>The Keres is in trouble!"

