// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - MaxStory 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Communicator 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P3382969956" "<color Cornflowerblue>Max activates the computer in order to communicate with Battle Maiden.</color><br><br>What do you want, worm? You are not one of the strong who bested me in battle, none of you deserve to be within my sight!<br><br>Marcus Cole of Praetoria shall return for me, and then I shall take delight in crushing you and your pathetic army one by one!"
// Answer Text :
"P3649024751" "Whoah, easy there lady, I'm on your side."
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P524741889" "What?<br><br><color Cornflowerblue>Max explains to Battle Maiden the situation, being incredibly blunt about everything that's happening.</color><br><br>So... I have been betrayed by Marcus Cole. I cannot say I am surprised. He lacks the will to do what must be done to send fear into your enemies.<br><br>Your group, Malta, will give me my freedom if I agree to utilize my nanites in your favor? Hah! I suppose this could be an interesting venture, at least more interesting than where I currently am."
// Answer Text :
"P1958338469" "Do we have an agreement?"
// Page InformationPage2 Text :
"P807748740" "If it means getting out of here, then yes, we have an agreement, 'Colonel Vanderby'.<br><br>I accept your terms and swear to help your organization of Malta become true warriors!"
// Answer Text :
"P3670538201" "... Right, okay, well, let me get you outta this place."
// Page InformationPage3 Text :
"P3447255354" "This world is full of super villains. They want to do evil things like take over the world."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P888734139" "<color CornflowerBlue>Max has fulfilled the task that was assigned to him: eliminate the rogue Knives of Vengeance, using any means necessary, even if it means working with {HeroName}. As soon as the task was finished, Max received information on his next assignment: resume his identity as a colonel within the Vanguard, and infiltrate one of their bases located in Siberia.<br><br>The Malta organization discovered that Vanguard is holding Battle Maiden within that cell. Her expertise on nanite technology could prove incredibly useful to the organization, which is finding itself losing the battle of technology. They had sent their best trained men to deal with the Praetorians in Nerva Archipelago, only to find the Praetorians and Incarnate powered supers rolling over their technology.<br><br>The Director in charge of Praetorian conflict has confirmed that Emperor Cole has no intention of recovering Battle Maiden, not when she disobeyed a direct order and attacked the center of the city instead of a military target.<br><br>Max's mission is to recover Battle Maiden's halberd and, if he can manage it, Battle Maiden herself. Malta will then work with her to improve their technology in order to better handle Incarnate-powered threats.<br><br></color><br><br><color orange>This is a non-combat, personal story mission. In this mission, you will assume the role of your contact. This is a solo mission.</color>"
// AcceptString :
"P1158736215" "(Play Max's Personal Story)"
// SendOffString :
"P154433381" "<color CornflowerBlue>Max accepts the mission and heads off to handle the situation in Siberia. He will assume his role as Colonel Vanderby, a decorated and honored member of the Vanguard, who helped fight in the second Rikti War and has earned several medals for bravery in the field.<br><br>Malta will leave a teleporter in the submarine he will be taking. The base has several layers of security doors made of impervium, ready to shut in at a moment's notice to prevent any breakouts. The teleporter will silently get Battle Maiden out and leave Max enough time to get out of the base before any suspicion is aroused.</color>"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2961270289" "Max's Personal Story (Solo Mission)"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3670022025" "<color CornflowerBlue>Max will have to access the base in Siberia and recover Battle Maiden's gear and the woman herself, if she's willing to come along.</color>"
// FlashbackRequiresFailedText :
"P275791369" "<color orange>You must be a VIP, not on a team and have already completed Max's personal story in order to play this mission.</color>"
// TaskTitle :
"P3678833684" "<color deepskyblue>Max's Personal Story (Dark Astoria)</color>"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P3050318646" "<color deepskyblue>To Protect the Nation</color>"

